{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You are in the pit. Now there's only one way: up</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Jump Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide a lost soul using only the mouse. The movement is done using a different jump mechanic, which mixes intuition with precision. In addition, discover other skills along the way to enhance your mobility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/ort.gif?t=1747094751\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/gif_space3.gif?t=1747094751\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience the 3 Circles of Hell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In Climb Out of Hell, you must: emerge from the bottom of the scalding pit, where your initial skills will be tested. Unravel the mysteries of the Dark Forest, where fragments of your memory echoes and beg for your encounter. And finally, overcome the deadly cold of a Frozen Kingdom, where SHE resides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/Gif_SmileyEN.gif?t=1747094751\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/Gif_LimboEN.gif?t=1747094751\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/Gif_ICEEN.gif?t=1747094751\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Surreal-Sentimental Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you navigate the circles of hell, meet charming (and bizarre) characters in a world rich in stories told and sung with dialogues, prose and even music. The story of Climb Out of Hell takes place in a fantastic hell where humans are not the only race of beings with language, history and culture, and respect for spirits must be considered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/Gif_EldersEN.gif?t=1747094751\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, if you pass by the three children of the eternal guardian of  Paradise, you may have a chance to ascend. No soul has managed to escape this hell, legends say that only those who master pain, fear and their own shadow can be worthy of redemption. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you climb out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Made in\u00a0</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/Wikipedia-Flags-BR-Brazil-Flag.16.png?t=1747094751\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712580?t=1747094751","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712580?t=1747094751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/cea9b8cf8640a8b7ce4e3f077cd925f7a47521cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747094751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/cea9b8cf8640a8b7ce4e3f077cd925f7a47521cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747094751","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\