aracters in a world rich in stories told and sung with dialogues, prose and even music. The story of Climb Out of Hell takes place in a fantastic hell where humans are not the only race of beings with language, history and culture, and respect for spirits must be considered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/Gif_EldersEN.gif?t=1747094751\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, if you pass by the three children of the eternal guardian of  Paradise, you may have a chance to ascend. No soul has managed to escape this hell, legends say that only those who master pain, fear and their own shadow can be worthy of redemption. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you climb out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Made in\u00a0</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/extras/Wikipedia-Flags-BR-Brazil-Flag.16.png?t=1747094751\" /></div></p>","developers":["Uendy "],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712580/280bc0efe9018908689af1d8d6ed8ce338527a23/header.jpg?t=1747094751","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137589,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137589/movie480.mp4?t=1746850231","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr